<p>ArtStation is moving its marketplace to Gumroad. To keep selling, do these three things:</p>
<ol>
  <li><a href="#the-link">Open the link ArtStation emails you</a>, and sign in to Gumroad or create an account.</li>
  <li><a href="#getting-paid">Set your payout method</a> in <a href="https://gumroad.com/settings/payments">Payments settings</a>.</li>
  <li><a href="#drafts">Check each product, then publish it</a>.</li>
</ol>
<p>ArtStation's emails give you the dates for your store.</p>

<strong>In this article:</strong>
<ul>
  <li><a href="#what-changes">What changes for you</a></li>
